# --- Impact Crater runtime data ---
# Per ADR-0006, the app writes to ~/.impact-crater/ by default. This
# guard catches accidental writes inside the repo (e.g. a test that
# forgets to override IMPACT_CRATER_HOME).
.impact-crater/
impact_crater.egg-info/

